@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Microwave Oven

[*] --> Idle

state "Idle" as Idle
Idle : entry / Display current time
Idle : do / Wait for user input

Idle --> WaitingForInput

state "Waiting for input" as WaitingForInput
WaitingForInput : entry / User chooses power level (full or half)
WaitingForInput : do / Set cooking time by entering a number
WaitingForInput --> Cooking

state "Cooking" as Cooking
Cooking : entry / Door is closed during operation
Cooking : do / Cooking process in progress
Cooking --> OpenDoorDuringOperation

state "Open door during operation" as OpenDoorDuringOperation
OpenDoorDuringOperation : entry / Door opened during cooking
OpenDoorDuringOperation : do / Stop cooking immediately
OpenDoorDuringOperation --> Stopped

state "Stopped" as Stopped
Stopped : entry / User cancels cooking process
Stopped : do / Return to idle state after stopping or cancelling

Stopped --> Idle : [User stops or cancels cooking]

Idle --> WaitingForInput : [System waits for next use]
@enduml
